window.CET6_DATA("data/articles/day-065.json",{"day":65,"title":"Testing a Water Filter Before Trusting It","targetWords":[{"word":"arbitrary","gloss":"任意的","context":"The team wrote an explicit, concise testing plan rather than making an arbitrary purchase.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"explicit","gloss":"明确的","context":"The team wrote an explicit, concise testing plan rather than making an arbitrary purchase.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"scarce","gloss":"稀少的","context":"A village where clean water was already scarce faced an imminent shortage after an abrupt flood damaged its supply pipes.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"transparent","gloss":"透明的","context":"Its transparent case also made it look trustworthy.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"adverse","gloss":"不利的","context":"A miniature trial compared treated and untreated water under adverse conditions.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"bizarre","gloss":"奇异的","context":"The supplier initially dismissed the criticism as bizarre, claiming that it had developed a better solution than any competitor.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"coherent","gloss":"一致的","context":"This commonplace answer was stale marketing rather than a coherent response.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"commonplace","gloss":"平凡的","context":"This commonplace answer was stale marketing rather than a coherent response.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"compact","gloss":"紧凑的","context":"The device was compact, handy, and compatible with existing taps.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"compatible","gloss":"兼容","context":"The device was compact, handy, and compatible with existing taps.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":{"en":"compatible with","zh":"与……相适应"}},{"word":"susceptible","gloss":"易受感染的","context":"Children and older residents were particularly susceptible to infection, so a negligible improvement would not be enough.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"void","gloss":"无效的","context":"Calling the approval void would have gone too far, but using it as universal proof of safety would have been equally misleading.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"concise","gloss":"简明的","context":"The team wrote an explicit, concise testing plan rather than making an arbitrary purchase.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"foremost","gloss":"最重要的","context":"The foremost question was whether it could remove the actual contaminants in the local water.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"foul","gloss":"犯规","context":"Some smelled foul, although the visible sediment represented only a fraction of the danger.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"negligible","gloss":"微不足道的","context":"Children and older residents were particularly susceptible to infection, so a negligible improvement would not be enough.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"robust","gloss":"强健的","context":"A robust design had to perform consistently across different sources.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"shallow","gloss":"浅的","context":"Samples came from shallow wells and from a river still turbulent with floodwater.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"tentative","gloss":"暂时的","context":"A tentative finding suggested that the filter worked well at an intermediate flow rate but poorly when water rushed through it.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":{"en":"a tentative plan","zh":"暂定计划"}},{"word":"turbulent","gloss":"动荡的","context":"Samples came from shallow wells and from a river still turbulent with floodwater.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"abrupt","gloss":"突然的","context":"A village where clean water was already scarce faced an imminent shortage after an abrupt flood damaged its supply pipes.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"auxiliary","gloss":"辅助的","context":"They hired an auxiliary team to restore the pipes and secured an ample temporary supply.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"empirical","gloss":"实证的","context":"An advertisement for a fabulous new filter seemed promising, but its lofty claims offered little empirical evidence.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":{"en":"empirical evidence","zh":"实证证据"}},{"word":"feeble","gloss":"虚弱的","context":"The engineers refused to treat a feeble explanation about proprietary technology as a substitute for measurable safety results.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"nominal","gloss":"名义上的","context":"Its nominal certification covered conditions different from those in the village.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"transient","gloss":"短暂的","context":"Transient reassurance could be dangerous if it encouraged premature trust.","contextParagraph":4,"collocation":null},{"word":"consecutive","gloss":"连续的","context":"Three consecutive tests left certain bacteria intact.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"homogeneous","gloss":"同类的","context":"The supposedly homogeneous filtering material contained hollow spaces through which water could escape treatment.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"intact","gloss":"原封不动的","context":"Three consecutive tests left certain bacteria intact.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"lofty","gloss":"高的","context":"An advertisement for a fabulous new filter seemed promising, but its lofty claims offered little empirical evidence.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"miniature","gloss":"小型的","context":"A miniature trial compared treated and untreated water under adverse conditions.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"swift","gloss":"迅速的","context":"A forthcoming visit by health inspectors added pressure, and officials wanted a swift solution.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"equity","gloss":"公平","context":"Equity required distributing that supply according to need rather than ability to pay, particularly when residents were still recovering from the flood.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"forthcoming","gloss":"即将到来的","context":"A forthcoming visit by health inspectors added pressure, and officials wanted a swift solution.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"futile","gloss":"无用的","context":"Local officials accepted that a futile argument over prestige would delay essential repairs.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"handy","gloss":"方便的","context":"The device was compact, handy, and compatible with existing taps.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"hollow","gloss":"空的","context":"The supposedly homogeneous filtering material contained hollow spaces through which water could escape treatment.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"intermediate","gloss":"中间体","context":"A tentative finding suggested that the filter worked well at an intermediate flow rate but poorly when water rushed through it.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"invaluable","gloss":"无价的","context":"Independent tests were invaluable because they turned impressive promises into questions that could be answered.","contextParagraph":4,"collocation":null},{"word":"okay","gloss":"安全可用","context":"When residents asked whether the water was okay to drink, officials gave specific evidence and explained any remaining uncertainty.","contextParagraph":4,"collocation":null},{"word":"optimum","gloss":"最佳的","context":"Yet an engineer warned that an attractive form did not establish an optimum treatment method.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"stale","gloss":"陈腐的","context":"This commonplace answer was stale marketing rather than a coherent response.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"viable","gloss":"可行的","context":"The device was therefore viable only after substantial changes.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"apt","gloss":"恰当的","context":"The engineers offered an apt comparison: a bridge certificate for light vehicles did not justify sending every truck across it.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"better","gloss":"更好的","context":"The supplier initially dismissed the criticism as bizarre, claiming that it had developed a better solution than any competitor.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"fabulous","gloss":"极好的","context":"An advertisement for a fabulous new filter seemed promising, but its lofty claims offered little empirical evidence.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"formidable","gloss":"强大的","context":"The episode showed that a formidable emergency did not remove the need for careful reasoning.","contextParagraph":4,"collocation":null},{"word":"imminent","gloss":"逼近的","context":"A village where clean water was already scarce faced an imminent shortage after an abrupt flood damaged its supply pipes.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"redundant","gloss":"多余的","context":"A redundant plastic guard made repairs awkward, while a stiff fitting broke when installers tightened it.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"stiff","gloss":"硬的","context":"A redundant plastic guard made repairs awkward, while a stiff fitting broke when installers tightened it.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null}],"paragraphs":[{"en":"A village where clean water was already scarce faced an imminent shortage after an abrupt flood damaged its supply pipes. A forthcoming visit by health inspectors added pressure, and officials wanted a swift solution. An advertisement for a fabulous new filter seemed promising, but its lofty claims offered little empirical evidence. The device was compact, handy, and compatible with existing taps. Its transparent case also made it look trustworthy. Yet an engineer warned that an attractive form did not establish an optimum treatment method. The foremost question was whether it could remove the actual contaminants in the local water.","zh":"洪水突然损坏供水管，本就缺水的村庄即将出现短缺，卫生检查员将来访，又添压力。官员想迅速解决，所谓极好新滤器的广告看似有前景，但崇高宣称缺实验证据。设备紧凑、方便、兼容现有水龙头，透明外壳也显可信。工程师提醒，外形好看不等于处理最佳，首要问题是能否去除当地水里真正的污染物。"},{"en":"The team wrote an explicit, concise testing plan rather than making an arbitrary purchase. A miniature trial compared treated and untreated water under adverse conditions. Samples came from shallow wells and from a river still turbulent with floodwater. Some smelled foul, although the visible sediment represented only a fraction of the danger. Children and older residents were particularly susceptible to infection, so a negligible improvement would not be enough. A robust design had to perform consistently across different sources. The engineers refused to treat a feeble explanation about proprietary technology as a substitute for measurable safety results.","zh":"团队写明确简洁测试计划，而不随意采购。小规模试验在不利条件下比较处理前后水，样本来自浅井和仍湍急的河。部分气味恶臭，肉眼泥沙却只代表一部分危险。儿童老人容易感染，微不足道改善不够；坚实设计需在不同水源持续有效。工程师拒绝用无力的“专有技术”解释代替可测量安全结果。"},{"en":"A tentative finding suggested that the filter worked well at an intermediate flow rate but poorly when water rushed through it. Three consecutive tests left certain bacteria intact. The supposedly homogeneous filtering material contained hollow spaces through which water could escape treatment. A redundant plastic guard made repairs awkward, while a stiff fitting broke when installers tightened it. The device was therefore viable only after substantial changes. Its nominal certification covered conditions different from those in the village. Calling the approval void would have gone too far, but using it as universal proof of safety would have been equally misleading.","zh":"初步发现显示滤器在中等流速效果好，过快则差。连续三次测试仍有部分细菌完整存在。号称均一的滤材含空隙，水可绕过处理。多余塑料罩阻碍维修，僵硬接口在拧紧时断裂，所以设备须大改才可行。名义认证对应的条件不同于村庄。认定认证全无效过头，但当成普遍安全证明也同样误导。"},{"en":"The supplier initially dismissed the criticism as bizarre, claiming that it had developed a better solution than any competitor. This commonplace answer was stale marketing rather than a coherent response. The engineers offered an apt comparison: a bridge certificate for light vehicles did not justify sending every truck across it. Local officials accepted that a futile argument over prestige would delay essential repairs. They hired an auxiliary team to restore the pipes and secured an ample temporary supply. Equity required distributing that supply according to need rather than ability to pay, particularly when residents were still recovering from the flood.","zh":"供应商起初认为批评古怪，声称方案比所有竞争者好。这是老生常谈的陈旧营销，不是连贯回应。工程师作了恰当比喻：允许轻车的桥梁认证，不支持任意卡车通过。官员接受争论声望毫无用处，还会延误必要维修。他们雇辅助团队修管，并确保充足临时水，按需求而非支付能力分配，尤其居民仍在洪灾恢复中。"},{"en":"The final arrangement was less dramatic than the original advertisement, but it kept households supplied while reliable repairs proceeded. When residents asked whether the water was okay to drink, officials gave specific evidence and explained any remaining uncertainty. The episode showed that a formidable emergency did not remove the need for careful reasoning. Transient reassurance could be dangerous if it encouraged premature trust. Independent tests were invaluable because they turned impressive promises into questions that could be answered. A sensible public decision combined urgency with verification, protecting people without assuming that the most confident seller necessarily offered the best solution.","zh":"最终安排不如原广告耀眼，却在可靠维修期间维持家庭供水。居民问水能否喝，官员给具体证据并解释剩余不确定性。事件表明，严峻应急不消除认真推理的必要，短暂安慰若促使过早信任会危险。独立测试无价，因为它把精彩承诺变成可回答问题。合理公共决策结合紧迫与核实，不假设最自信销售者必有最佳方案。"}],"previous":64,"next":66});
